@startuml
title D21 - Sequence hoàn tất giao dịch và đánh giá
autonumber

actor "Buyer/Seller" as User
participant "React SPA" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Order Repository" as OrderRepo
database "order_db" as OrderDB
queue NATS
participant "Review Service" as Review
participant "Review Repository" as ReviewRepo
database "review_db" as ReviewDB

User -> Web : Xác nhận hoàn tất
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/transactions/{id}/status
Gateway -> Order : UpdateTransactionStatus(completed) [gRPC]
Order -> OrderRepo : FindTransactionByID(id)
OrderRepo -> OrderDB : SELECT transaction
OrderDB --> OrderRepo : Transaction
Order -> OrderRepo : UpdateTransaction(status=completed)
OrderRepo -> OrderDB : UPDATE transactions
Order -> OrderRepo : CreateTransactionEvent(from, to, actor)
OrderRepo -> OrderDB : INSERT transaction_events
Order -> NATS : publish cme.orders.transaction.completed
Order --> Gateway : Transaction(completed)
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200
Web --> User : Hiển thị hoàn tất

== Người dùng chủ động gửi đánh giá ==
User -> Web : Nhập rating và comment
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/reviews + JWT
Gateway -> Review : CreateReview(request) [gRPC]
Review -> ReviewRepo : Create(review)
ReviewRepo -> ReviewDB : INSERT reviews
ReviewDB --> ReviewRepo : OK
Review --> Gateway : Review
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 201
Web --> User : Hiển thị đánh giá thành công

note over Order,NATS
  Sự kiện completed được publish,
  nhưng chưa có consumer trong Notification Service.
end note
@enduml

